{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t數碼通表示，早前受影響的網絡服務現已陸續恢復正常，並再次為事件造成的不便致歉。<br/>\n<br/>\n數碼通在社交專頁表示，若客戶未能正常使用服務，可重新啟動手機，或開啟並關閉飛行模式，若問題持續，可與公司聯絡。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:23:24.290711+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:06:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:23.314379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:48.127141+00:00","content_hash":"f5da21435347c5f742e33f2f4d5f365216d27d71c57f7136ef0e724688fd9818","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}